    apply: "Set aside time to ask God to search you, write down sins and receive forgiveness. Seek reconciliation with someone you have wronged. Consider with your leaders a time of corporate confession. Recover one practice of first love. Memorise 1 John 1:9.",
    activity: "Read Joel 2:12-17 and Revelation 2:1-7. Spend a silent time of self-examination with Psalm 51 as a guide. Write a corporate confession for your church. Share in small groups and pray.",
