    apply: "Begin a Bible-reading plan and share it with a friend. Prepare for next Sunday's sermon by praying and reading the text. Afterwards, write one thing to obey. Pray for your pastor. Memorise Isaiah 55:11.",
    activity: "Read Acts 2:14-41 and outline Peter's sermon. Discuss what made it effective. Read Hebrews 4:12-13 and share experiences of Scripture speaking to you. Pray for preachers and listeners.",
