    teacher: "Encourage learners with limited literacy by offering audio Bibles and group reading. Avoid elevating particular preachers. Emphasise the word and the Spirit. Be respectful of preaching styles that differ across churches.",
    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners why the word is central to revival.",
    mcq1: ["What does Romans 10:17 say?", ["Faith comes from hearing, and hearing through the word of Christ", "Faith comes from seeing", "Faith comes from wealth", "Faith comes from tradition"], 0, "Faith comes from hearing the word."],
