    sa: ["What is the place of the word and preaching in revival?", ["bible", "christ", "faith", "hearing", "obey", "spirit"], "A good answer says revival is marked by faithful preaching of Christ from Scripture, hearts hungry to hear and obey, and the Spirit applying the living word to convict and renew."],
